CE-BiD: Cloud-Edge Collaborative Time-Series Forecasting
========================================================

This repository is derived from and extends the Time-Series-Library (TSLib):
https://github.com/thuml/Time-Series-Library

TSLib is Copyright (c) 2021 THUML @ Tsinghua University and is distributed
under the MIT License. The original copyright and permission notice are
retained in LICENSE.

Project-specific additions include the lightweight CNN edge model,
cloud-to-edge distillation, reverse distillation, OFA-style regression
distillation, local personalization, and the event-triggered online simulator.

The OFA adaptation is inspired by:
Hao et al., "One-for-All: Bridge the Gap Between Heterogeneous Architectures
in Knowledge Distillation", NeurIPS 2023.
https://github.com/Hao840/OFAKD
